YosysHQ embeds 'yosys' in its distribution bundle.

This package is built using packages: 'abc' 'bigint' 'boost_regex' 'cxxopts' 'dlfcn-win32' 'flex' 'fmt' 'libfst' 'json11' 'minisat' 'sha1' 'slang' 'symfpu' 'tomlplusplus' 'sv-elab' 

Build is based on folowing sources:
================================================================================
git https://github.com/YosysHQ/yosys checkout revision 37f25dae90177888ac89573be92c3826da71f26e

